{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Giraud公理"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Giraud 公理"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>据 "},{"Local":{"url":"SGA4","text":"SGA 4"}},{"Plain":" 记载, Grothendieck 的学生 Giraud 惊人地给出了 "},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"Grothendieck 意象"}},{"Plain":"的纯范畴论刻画, 后来称为 <strong>Giraud 公理</strong>. 这说明意象还具有一种独立于几何对象的观点.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>称 $\\infty$-范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 满足 <strong>Giraud 公理</strong>是说如下条件成立:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"可表现范畴","text":"可表现范畴"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":"保持"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"和"}},{"Plain":"无交 (即 $X + Y$ 的子对象 $X$ 与 $Y$ 的交为"},{"Local":{"url":"始对象","text":"始对象"}},{"Plain":" $0$);</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"群胚对象","text":"群胚对象"}},{"Plain":"均有效, 即等价于商映射的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Čech脉","text":"Čech 脉"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}